                <pb facs="0951" n="835" sameAs="frus:frus1923v01/pg835"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">711.1828/5: Telegram</note>
                <head><hi rendition="#italic">The Minister in Costa Rica</hi> (<hi
                        rendition="#italic">Davis</hi>) <hi rendition="#italic">to the Secretary of
                        State</hi></head>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >San José</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1923-03-27T20:00:00-06:00"><hi rendition="#italic">March 27,
                                1923—8 p.m.</hi></date><lb/>[Received March 28—4:40
                    p.m.]</dateline></opener>
                <p>19. My 12, March 2, 4 p.m.<anchor n="3" xml:id="d663-f1"/> I have been informed
                    that ratification of Canal protocol is doubtful. …</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">Davis</hi></signed></closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
